sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant FE as LoginScreen
  participant C as AuthController
  participant S as AuthService
  participant R as UserRepository
  participant J as JwtService
  U->>FE: Email and password
  FE->>C: POST /api/v1/auth/login
  C->>S: login(LoginRequest)
  S->>R: Find by email, case-insensitive
  alt wrong credentials or inactive
    S-->>C: 400 Invalid email or password
  else valid
    S->>J: generateToken(user)
    J-->>S: JWT, 24 h
    S-->>C: AuthResponse(token, mustChangePassword)
    C-->>FE: 200 OK
    FE->>C: POST /auth/change-password (if required)
    C->>S: changePassword(userId, req)
    S->>R: save(mustChangePassword = false)
  end
